# Play test of The Drowned Gate (CIPlay drowned_gate, in a test world 'CI ...'). Points as in its recipe (its gate frame
# turned into the island's): the north pad (5 m) with the lock keeper's house and his count, the wall's deck (5.05 m) from
# the pad through the pump room to the lock's deck (the outer gate's lever, the inner gate's wheel) and the gate office,
# the lock chamber under the deck (water, 4 m deep) between the two gates, the flooded pump hall beside it (its door in
# the chamber's north wall, the chest on its floor 3.95 m down).
island The Drowned Gate
expect step 0
expect title Locks and Pumps
wait 5

# Onto the wall from the north pad: along the pad past the keeper's house, onto the deck's end
walk 57.17 6.99 to 44 11.69 to 41.29 7.35 h=5.05
zone wall
expect step 1
read Lock keeper's count
expect step 2

# Along the deck through the pump room to the lock's deck; the outer gate's lever; into the lock
walk 41.29 7.35 to 39.27 1.7 to 37.59 -3.01 to 35.57 -8.66 to 37.05 -10.78 h=5.05
use outerlever
expect message chain rattles
wait 6
log the gates after the lever (the outer one sunk 7.4 m):
where TP_SeleneEntranceGate
at 35.6 -11.86 h=0.3
zone lockgate
expect step 3

# The keeper's crowbar: in at his house's door, his locker
walk 46.2 7.46 to 48.08 6.79 to 49.68 6.22 h=5.2 below=8
open Lock keeper's locker
expect story crowbar 1
expect step 4

# Back in the lock: the pump hall's jammed door, its flooded hall, the angler, the chest on the floor
at 35.74 -8.19 h=0.3
use pumpdoor
expect message screeches open
wait 2
at 36.75 -5.36 h=0.3
zone pumphall
expect step 5
kill Angler fish
expect step 6
open Pump hall chest
expect story lockkey 1
expect step 7

# The inner lock's wheel on the lock's deck; the inner gate and the office's door open; into the gate office
walk 41.29 7.35 to 39.27 1.7 to 37.59 -3.01 to 35.57 -8.66 to 33.6 -13.9 h=5.05
zone innerlock
expect step 8
use innerwheel
expect message the wheel spins
expect story lockkey 0
wait 3
walk 34.23 -12.43 to 32.55 -17.14 to 31.16 -19.83 h=5.05 below=7.5
zone gateoffice
expect step 9
open Gate office vault
wait 4
expect item Blueprint_TitaniumTools 1
expect item Blueprint_ZiplineToolElectric 1
expect done
